## Phase 6 — `/speckit.checklist` (visual conformance)

```
/speckit.checklist Generate a visual and behavioural conformance checklist for the
Portfolio Overview screen. One checkable item per component covering: correct token used
for every visual property, auto-layout spacing matches Figma, responsive behaviour at each
breakpoint, all four data states implemented and matching their Figma variant node, no
literal hex or px values present, and every figure labelled with unit, currency and as-of
date. Reference node IDs from design-context.md so a reviewer can compare side by side.
```

Checklists act as unit tests for English — here you're pointing that mechanic at pixels.
Output lands in `specs/002-portfolio-overview/checklists/visual.md` and becomes your PR
review script.

